      "body": "网址地址：[remomod.com](https://repomod.com/)\n网站包含了当前最热门和最新的mod内容，并且每天都会更新最新版本，每周也会增加多个mod内容，包含但不限于一下mod内容。\n1. REPOLib v1.5.0\nA foundational library for adding content to R.E.P.O., providing essential tools and frameworks for mod development.[Learn more →](https://repomod.com/repomod-REPOLib)\n2. BensCosmetics v1.4.1\nAdds over 150 new models and cosmetics to enhance character customization options.[Learn more →](https://repomod.com/repomod-BensCosmetics)\n3. MoreHead v1.2.8 & MoreHeadPlus v0.3.0\nExpands head customization options with new models and features.[Learn more →](https://repomod.com/repomod-MoreHead)\n4. MoreShopItems v1.2.6\nEnhances the shopping experience with additional items and customization options.[Learn more →](https://repomod.com/repomod-MoreShopItems)\n5. MenuLib v2.1.1\nA powerful library for creating UI elements and enhancing menu functionality.[Learn more →](https://repomod.com/repomod-MenuLib)\n6. MoreUpgrades v1.3.8\nIntroduces new upgrade items and enhances the upgrade system.[Learn more →](https://repomod.com/repomod-MoreUpgrades)\n7. ExtractionPointConfirmButton\nAdds a confirmation button to extraction points for better user experience.[Learn more →](https://repomod.com/repomod-ExtractionPointConfirmButton)\n8. MoreReviveHP v1.0.1\nIncreases the amount of health given when reviving teammates.[Learn more →](https://repomod.com/repomod-MoreReviveHP)\n9. LateJoin v0.1.2\nAllows late players to join during intermissions for better team coordination.[Learn more →](https://repomod.com/repomod-LateJoin)\n10. TeamUpgrades v1.1.4\nShares upgrades across the team for better cooperative gameplay.[Learn more →](https://repomod.com/repomod-TeamUpgrades)\n11. TeamHeals v1.0.1\nMakes health packs work for the entire team, improving team support mechanics.[Learn more →](https://repomod.com/repomod-TeamHeals",
